  "description": "Native Microsoft.AspNetCore.OpenApi transformers for Viana.Results (no Swashbuckle required): unwraps Result/ListResult/PagedResult schemas, emits RFC 9457 problem responses, supports IExampleProvider<T> with [ResponseExample] attribute and global registration. Use this package when consuming AddOpenApi() + Scalar/Swagger UI; for Swashbuckle pipelines see Viana.Results.OpenApi.Swashbuckle.",
  "id": "Viana.Results.OpenApi",
