  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Native Microsoft.AspNetCore.OpenApi integration for Viana.Results (no Swashbuckle dependency) — wires up via AddOpenApi(opts => opts.AddVianaResultTransformers()).\n\t\t\tUnwraps Result<T>, ListResult<T> and PagedResult<T> schemas so the OpenAPI document exposes the actual payload shape instead of the wrapper.\n\t\t\tEmits RFC 9457 problem responses declared via [ProblemResult(status)] and auto-adds 401/403 responses to [Authorize] endpoints.\n\t\t\tAdds [ResponseExample] attribute and IExampleProvider<T> for typed response examples with method/class/global precedence.\n\t\t\tShares its mutation logic with Viana.Results.OpenApi.Swashbuckle via Viana.Results.OpenApi.Processing, so both pipelines emit an identical document.",
